{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790848200, "covers_from": "2026-10-01T09:50:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-01T09:51:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790848260, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-01T09:50:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "queue_number": 54809, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "敦化圓環的動線對機車族非常不友善 台北每個圓環都是 很多馬路對機車族也很不友善", "display_name": "大安代表 No.54,809", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-01T09:50:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 37651, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北市各個行政區道路增加了很多複雜的槽化線,使得交通更紊亂和壅塞,簡直是罰單陷阱和路障，增加行車風險", "display_name": "士林代表 No.37,651", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-01T09:50:27+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 43158, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "觀光", "content": "我去台北都不知道要玩什麼，以前不是這樣的", "display_name": "中山代表 Vicky", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-01T09:50:33+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34853, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "長照", "content": "我想瞭解台北市有沒有可能創建一個社區，是老年人和青壯年可以互助共生的社區住宅？ 市長候選人的團隊規劃", "display_name": "文山代表 毓惠Debby", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-01T09:50:48+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35384, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "腳踏車專用車道，路線規劃斷斷續續、常常被卸貨的阻擋、差點被臨停下車的車門擊落", "display_name": "中山代表 No.35,384", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 37651, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.37,651", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 43158, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 Vicky", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true